  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance component of the EFSD+ EDFI MSME Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objective of the Action is to support the management of the EDFI MSME Platform (the Programme), so to ensure that EU pillar assessed DFIs can benefit from the Guarantee Component of the Programme under equal terms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Programme seeks to address financial constraints faced by micro, small and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs) and local financial institutions (LFIs) in countries in Sub-Saharan Africa (SSA) and in the EU Neighborhood region. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
